          "endAtNextDay": false,
          "description": "<p>Visit the spectacular cave of Can Marçà, which has been fitted out for guided tours that include light, sound and water shows. Learn about the history of this cave, which is over 100 years old and for years was the hideout of smugglers. The best plan for the family!</p><br><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<p>Open all year round.</p><br><br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat's included<br />\r\n<p>- Duration of the visit: 40 minutes approx.</p><br />\r\n<p>- Guided tours in various languages.</p><br><br />\r\n<br />\r\nImportant information<br />\r\n<p>- Opening times: May to October 10:30am - 7:30pm (visit every 30 minutes); November to April 10:30am - 5:30pm (visits every 45 minutes) </p><br />\r\n<p class=\"tdfocus-1768824443465\">- Location:Port of San Miguel </p><br />\r\n<p>- Visit recommended for all ages. </p>",
          "requirements": "<p class=\"tdfocus-1706807206684\"><b>IMPORTANT: </b></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1706807206684\"><b>- You must contact Cova de Can Marça to confirm availability. Contact details: (+34) 971 33 47 76 | info@covadecanmarsa.com</b></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1706807206684\">-------<br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1706807206684\">-No age limit.<br>- The cave is located at the San Miguel Port.<br>- Opening times: May to October 10:30am - 7:30pm (visit every 30 minutes); November to April 10:30am - 5:30pm (visits every 45 minutes)</p><p>- This voucher must be exchanged for a ticket at the cave's ticket office.<br></p>",
          "affLink": "https://www.clubtickets.com/activities/cova-de-can-marca/cova-de-can-marca?aff=CT219",
